    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nNo 28 Danesfort Court is a modern semi-detached property, located in a private, well established residential development within walking distance of Loughrea town centre and all it's social and recreational amenities.\n\nBoasting bright and spacious accommodation, this impressive residence is presented for sale in excellent condition, affording one the opportunity here to acquire a quality home in a most convenient location.\n\nViewing by appointment through selling agent."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - 1.92m x 5.58m\nFront aspect window and door, understair storage, wooden floor\n\nSitting Room - 4.03m x 5.11m\nFront aspect window, solid fuel insert stove with marble surround, wooden floor\n\nKitchen/Diner - 6.12m x 4.68m\nRear aspect window and French doors leading to patio, pvc wall and base units, granite work tops, tiled floor\n\nUtility Room - 2.19m x 2.97m\nRear aspect window and door, pvc wall and base units, granite work tops, tiled floor\n\nGround Floor wc - 1.92m x 1.09m\nwhb/wc, floor to ceiling tiles\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 3.58m x 1.87m\nCarpet flooring, Stira stairs to attic, attic boarded\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.32m x 4.73m\nFront aspect window, carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.13m x 3.28m\nFront aspect window, fitted wardrobe, carpet flooringEn-Suite: 2.45m x 0.87mSide aspect window, whb/wc/shower, floor to ceiling tiles\n\nBathroom - 2.39m 1.88m\nSide aspect window, whb/wc/bath with over-head shower, floor to ceiling tiles\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.50m x 3.61m\nRear aspect window, fitted wardrobe, carpet flooring\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.52m x 3.57m\nRear aspect window, fitted wardrobe, carpet flooring\n\nGarden - \nDriveway, side access to rear garden, patio and gravel, mature laurel tree boundary\n\n"
      },
